Hi Travis –

The Clerk of the Board just sent me a report with the names of the CSPG Group members that did not file their Form 700.

For the Spring Valley CPG Roger Garay’s name is on the list for having not completed his Form 700 online. At this time, he has received numerous notices from the Clerk of the Board to complete his Form 700 along with instructions.
 The COB will be sending the list of non-filers to the Board of Supervisors and the District Attorney’s office and then to Fair Political Practices Commission for the State of California no later than June 1st to take further action.

Can you please contact Roger and have him contact the Clerk of the Board immediately to resolve this matter?  They can be reached by phone at:

(619) 531-5601 or via email: Form700@sdcounty.ca.gov

Thanks!

Dawn Noble | Program Coordinator | Support Services

Planning & Development Services | Support Services

5510 Overland Avenue | Suite 310 | San Diego, CA 92123 MS: O-377

Cell: 619-629-5829

