Hello all,
 
The week for the graduation of the first cohort of the Equity Impact Grant
Program is finally here!
 
The Office of Equity and Racial Justice (OERJ) is excited to share this amazing
milestone with you on Friday, May 16th.
 
Please see below a few reminders for the day of:
 
Parking instructions for the day of the event are attached to this email
 
Encouraged Attire: Cocktail
 
Date and Time of Event: 5/16/2025 4:00 PM to 7:00 PM
 
Held At: Joan B. Kroc School of Peace Studies|University of San Diego
 
Address: 5555 Marian Way, San Diego, CA 92110
 
General Agenda: The grantees will begin tabling at 3:00 PM. Theatre doors
will open at 3:30 PM. Ceremony will take place from 4:00 PM to 6:35 PM.
Reception to follow.
 
Light refreshments will be provided after the ceremony
 
If you have any questions or concerns, please reach out to OERJ
(OERJ@sdcounty.ca.gov) no later than Thursday, May 15th at noon to give us
enough time to answer before the day of the event.
 
We look forward to seeing and celebrating with you all on Friday!
 
Best,
 
Kasandra Martinez-Topete
